{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fields of Mine</strong> is a roguelike built on classic Minesweeper \u2014 but with twists that reward sharp eyes and smart choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730410/extras/77fea9e1dbf24dd1082a5103d2298e9a.avif?t=1755157472\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore paths where each field is a puzzle. Some grids are modified with tricky effects: inverted numbers, hidden hints, additional mines, time bombs, or trap tiles that trigger a chain reaction. You can take a break before each boss, but after that it only gets harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730410/extras/5b7cf53005b81d65f42eb9d5cb304708.avif?t=1755157472\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold to spend in shops and gain upgrades: fewer mines, extra lives, shields, auto-flags or bonus safe reveals. The deeper you go, the harder it gets \u2014 but every mistake is a lesson. And if you fall short, you can always start fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730410/extras/f424a8b539cf646a4ff4d216204b0778.avif?t=1755157472\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730410?t=1755157472","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730410?t=1755157472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730410/bde4f36fee1096b0a5ae81d06d4126a2b644967a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755157472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite